{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:01.98] Nine, nine, nine\n[00:03.28] In the building (Oh, woah)\n[00:04.26] Ayy, hit her in the building (Oh, woah)\n[00:06.92] Okay, uh (Uh, uh)\n[00:07.76] Really feel myself, but sometimes I feel different (Sometimes I feel different)\n[00:13.76] I'm feelin' myself, but sometimes I feel different (Sometimes I feel different)\n[00:20.28] Always been myself, but sometimes I feel different (Sometimes I feel different)\n[00:23.48] Uh, uh, ooh-woah\n[Chorus]\n[00:26.94] I always been myself, but sometimes I feel different (Ooh-woah)\n[00:30.26] I got it all, but it feel like it's something missing (Ooh-woah)\n[00:33.22] I came a long way from skipping school and smoking Swisher's (Ooh-woah)\n[00:36.36] Used to keep a .40 that'll clean a nigga, dirty dishes (Ooh-woah)\n[00:39.80] Now I got a gun that'll beam 'em up, like Scotty Pippen (Ooh-woah)\n[00:43.18] Banana clip'll go and eat 'em up, over the monkey business (Ooh-woah)\n[00:46.40] She tell me that she'll do whatever I want, she just wanna be with me (Ooh woah)\n[00:49.98] I told her, I don't want none of the fake love she tryna give me\n[Verse 1]\n[00:53.94] I don't want it, I don't want it\n[00:56.80] But I ain't never runnin', my heart tougher than bricks\n[01:00.08] Okay, it's not tougher than bricks, actually, it's brittle as shit\n[01:03.60] But me admitting that to you is about as tough as it gets\n[01:06.92] She told me that she love me, she think I'm gon' fuck her for it\n[01:10.16] Every girl tell me she love me, I ain't finna fuck 'em for it\n[01:13.36] But since we on the topic of discussion, go 'head and fuck my boys\n[01:16.78] And you ain't fucking 'em right, if you ain't in the room makin' noise (Yeah)\n[01:20.18] I met this ho today on a boat, and frankly, I'm still annoyed (Oh yeah)\n[01:23.64] I'm tryna enjoy the water and this bitch was makin' me feel annoyed (Oh yeah)\n[01:26.76] She almost fought my girl, almost got beat up like my girl a boy (Oh yeah)\n[01:30.38] That's the end of my daily story, I'm gon' make you pay me for it (Oh-oh)\n[01:35.00] Time is such a great thing\n[01:36.78] It gives you the chance to wipe the slate clean\n[01:40.70] Percs have my brain weak, I'm quite high this evening\n[01:44.32] Keep the fannies, we may die this evening\n[Chorus]\n[01:48.02] I always been myself, but sometimes I feel different (Ooh-woah)\n[01:51.40] I got it all, but it feel like it's something missing (Ooh-woah)\n[01:54.34] I came a long way from skipping school and smoking Swisher's (Ooh-woah)\n[01:57.48] Used to keep a .40 that'll clean a nigga, dirty dishes (Ooh-woah)\n[02:01.12] Now I got a gun that'll beam 'em up, like Scotty Pippen (Ooh-woah)\n[02:04.32] Banana clip'll go and eat 'em up, over the monkey business (Ooh-woah)\n[02:07.86] She tell me that she'll do whatever I want, she just wanna be with me (Ooh woah)\n[02:11.12] I told her, I don't want none of the fake love she tryna give me\n[Verse 2]\n[02:15.44] I see it, all like I'm omniscient\n[02:18.12] Sometimes I can't see it all, I ain't omniscient\n[02:21.50] Time to leave, \"Bon voyage\", nigga, good riddance\n[02:25.14] I wrap cement around his leg, it's time to go fishing (Oh)\n[02:28.86] Get high as fuck, no comin' down (Uh-uh)\n[02:30.96] I really need to calm down (Uh-uh)\n[02:32.46] These Percocet get me signed out (Uh-uh)\n[02:34.16] They may knock my lights out (Uh-uh)\n[02:35.84] They pipe me up and pipe down (Uh-uh)\n[02:37.56] To the plane, need a time-out (Uh-uh)\n[02:39.02] They say you fuck my mans (Uh-uh)\n[02:40.52] Baby, don't let me find out (Uh-uh)\n[02:43.06] This ain't a rental, I hop in the Lambo and drive like a criminal\n[02:45.44] I'm gettin' more bread than a basket of dinner rolls\n[02:47.26] Dead rose, I ball out like Derrick Rose\n[02:49.18] I just spent 20K on Melrose\n[02:50.64] Came a long way from wearing shell toes\n[02:52.36] Diamonds on me and they wetter than water\n[02:53.96] Speakin' of water, I'm fresh off a sailboat\n[02:56.68] I've been up in my matrix\n[02:58.78] I've been gettin' high, faded\n[03:02.46] Blue pills take me to different places\n[03:05.88] Rearrangin', screwin' my brain in\n[Chorus]\n[03:09.12] I always been myself, but sometimes I feel different (Ooh-woah)\n[03:12.50] I got it all, but it feel like it's something missing (Ooh-woah)\n[03:15.48] I came a long way from skipping school and smoking Swisher's (Ooh-woah)\n[03:18.66] Used to keep a .40 that'll clean a nigga, dirty dishes (Ooh-woah)\n[03:22.12] Now I got a gun that'll beam 'em up, like Scotty Pippen (Ooh-woah)\n[03:25.10] Banana clip'll go and eat 'em up, over the monkey business (Ooh-woah)\n[03:29.30] She tell me that she'll do whatever I want, she just wanna be with me (Ooh woah)\n[04:03.50] I told her, I don't want none of the fake love she tryna give me","words":[[1.62,1.9,"[Intro]"],[1.98,2.14,"Nine,"],[2.36,2.56,"nine,"],[2.78,2.84,"nine"],[3.28,3.3,"In"],[3.34,3.4,"the"],[3.44,3.92,"building"],[3.98,4.0,"(Oh,"],[4.04,4.22,"woah)"],[4.26,4.36,"Ayy,"],[4.4,4.58,"hit"],[4.62,4.68,"her"],[4.76,4.78,"in"],[5.02,5.08,"the"],[5.42,5.8,"building"],[6.54,6.64,"(Oh,"],[6.7,6.88,"woah)"],[6.92,7.24,"Okay,"],[7.28,7.3,"uh"],[7.5,7.52,"(Uh,"],[7.62,7.66,"uh)"],[7.76,7.94,"Really"],[7.98,8.08,"feel"],[8.12,8.38,"myself,"],[8.42,8.54,"but"],[8.62,8.96,"sometimes"],[9.04,9.04,"I"],[9.22,9.4,"feel"],[9.44,9.8,"different"],[9.84,11.36,"(Sometimes"],[11.4,11.4,"I"],[11.52,11.64,"feel"],[11.96,13.72,"different)"],[13.76,13.82,"I'm"],[13.9,14.06,"feelin'"],[14.1,14.48,"myself,"],[14.52,14.6,"but"],[14.72,15.16,"sometimes"],[15.2,15.2,"I"],[15.36,15.5,"feel"],[15.56,17.22,"different"],[17.26,17.68,"(Sometimes"],[17.76,17.76,"I"],[17.9,18.04,"feel"],[18.3,19.36,"different)"],[20.28,20.6,"Always"],[20.68,20.8,"been"],[20.86,21.24,"myself,"],[21.3,21.4,"but"],[21.48,21.78,"sometimes"],[21.82,21.82,"I"],[21.92,22.0,"feel"],[22.04,22.22,"different"],[22.26,22.44,"(Sometimes"],[22.48,22.48,"I"],[22.52,22.62,"feel"],[22.66,22.84,"di